        "content": "<blockquote>\n  <p>Since the solution uses a temperature of 0.0</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/code/metric/nvidia-nemotron-metric\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kaggle.com/code/metric/nvidia-nemotron-metric</a>\n<code>temperature: float = 1.0,</code></p>",
