        "postDate": "2026-04-14T16:06:03.783Z",
        "rawMarkdown": ">Since the solution uses a temperature of 0.0\n\nhttps://www.kaggle.com/code/metric/nvidia-nemotron-metric\n`temperature: float = 1.0,`",
